## Properties

### Inert `inert` {#inert}

Any element with the `inert` Boolean attribute will have its content appear faded.

<nav inert><a href="javascript:history.go(-1)">Go Back</a></nav>

```html
<nav inert><a href="javascript:history.go(-1)">Go Back</a></nav>
```

